# React Components Library

## Project Structure

```
react_components_library/
├── src/
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── Button.tsx
│   │   ├── Card.tsx
│   │   ├── Modal.tsx
│   │   └── index.ts
│   ├── styles/
│   │   └── index.css
│   └── index.ts
├── examples/
│   ├── App.tsx
│   ├── main.tsx
│   └── index.css
├── index.html
├── package.json
├── tsconfig.json
├── tsconfig.node.json
├── vite.config.ts
├── README.md
└── LICENSE
```

## Development

### Install Dependencies
```bash
npm install
```

### Run Dev Server
```bash
npm run dev
```

The demo page will open at `http://localhost:5173`

### Build Library
```bash
npm run build
```

This creates the distributable library in the `dist/` folder.

## Component API

### Button
- Variants: primary, secondary, danger, success, outline
- Sizes: sm, md, lg
- Props: variant, size, fullWidth, isLoading, disabled, children

### Card
- Props: title, subtitle, image, header, body, footer, elevated, children

### Modal
- Props: isOpen, onClose, title, header, body, footer, showCloseButton, closeOnOverlayClick, size, children

## Features Implemented

✅ **Button Component**
- 5 visual variants (primary, secondary, danger, success, outline)
- 3 size options (sm, md, lg)
- Full width variant
- Loading state with spinner animation
- Disabled state
- Accessible with proper focus states

✅ **Card Component**
- Title and subtitle support
- Image support with alt text
- Flexible header, body, footer sections
- Elevated variant for emphasis
- Responsive grid layout
- Hover effects

✅ **Modal Component**
- Overlay backdrop with click-to-close
- Smooth animations (fade-in, slide-up)
- Keyboard support (Escape key)
- Close button
- Customizable header, body, footer
- Three size variants (sm, md, lg)
- Body scroll prevention
- Accessible ARIA attributes

## Styling

- CSS custom properties for easy theming
- Responsive design
- Smooth transitions and animations
- Accessible color contrasts
- Focus states for keyboard navigation
